WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.422 --> 00:00:03.478
Unit eighteen. My Role Models!

2
00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:11.121
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level two!

3
00:00:11.171 --> 00:00:14.743
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:18.546
Today we learn: My Role Models. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.762 --> 00:00:23.462
Role model. Say it with me. Role model!

6
00:00:26.967 --> 00:00:31.034
Inspire. Say it with me. Inspire!

7
00:00:34.494 --> 00:00:37.811
Admire. Say it with me. Admire!

8
00:00:41.377 --> 00:00:44.860
Achievement. Say it with me. Achievement!

9
00:00:48.345 --> 00:00:52.012
Influence. Say it with me. Influence!

10
00:00:55.537 --> 00:00:59.271
Example. Say it with me. Example!

11
00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:06.328
Values. Say it with me. Values!

12
00:01:09.805 --> 00:01:13.421
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

13
00:01:16.925 --> 00:01:26.212
Grammar time! Relative clauses with who. Listen. A role model is someone who inspires others.

14
00:01:26.262 --> 00:01:31.943
Your turn. Say it with me. A role model is someone who inspires others.

15
00:01:37.145 --> 00:01:49.777
A role model is someone who inspires you through their achievements and values. I admire people who set a good example and positively influence others. Their actions earn real respect.

16
00:01:49.827 --> 00:01:51.348
I like this story!

17
00:01:52.707 --> 00:01:57.882
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:57.932 --> 00:01:59.082
Admire!

19
00:02:00.114 --> 00:02:05.202
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:05.252 --> 00:02:06.402
Values!

21
00:02:07.384 --> 00:02:15.485
Think and answer. Who is your role model, and why do you admire them?

22
00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:16.685
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.064 --> 00:02:20.923
This unit's value is Inspiration.

24
00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:23.590
I can show inspiration every day!

25
00:02:24.312 --> 00:02:28.984
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:29.034 --> 00:02:30.657
Bye-bye, friends!

